*sigfree* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''sigfree(signums)''

Unregisters and restores the default signal handling behaviour for the operating system ''signums''.

*Parameters:*
- ''signums'': List of signal numbers

*Returns:*
- ''ok''

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if signums is not a list
- Runtime error if signums contains a non-number

*Important:*
Signal registration is process wide, not per actor runtime.

Calling ''sigfree(signums)'' restores the default behaviour of ''signums'' for the whole program.
